;; Cycle 07: the regulated profile (the compliance context), cut as spec-10
;; (tagged locally). Run by cycle 05's release; cycle 06's build is the cut's
;; implementation. Its scopes are what `rdm-spec scopes spec-9 spec-10` listed.
;; The shared files it named are read by those scopes: ClausesIndexed in
;; events.edn by checklist and release, the views by check's freshness stage,
;; which the model change leaves fresh. One builder takes all five scopes in
;; one room: the compliance context has no code yet, and the other four
;; scopes run its stages.
{:cut "spec-10"
 :scope [{:context :compliance}
         {:component :kernel/command}
         {:component :measurement/checklist}
         {:component :verification/release}]
 :builder {:name "a builder subagent, one room for every scope" :actor :agent}
 :grader {:name "grader subagents, each in its own grading room" :actor :agent}
 :spec-owner {:name "Sathish Narayanan" :actor :human}}
